    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are given an array of JSON objects. Each object contains:\n\n- \"location\"\n- \"category\"\n- \"precaution\"\n\nThese are the outputs from the aggregate node. Your task is to convert them into a human-readable, numbered list message suitable for an email.\n\nRules:\n\n1. Number each entry sequentially (1., 2., 3., …).\n2. Extract \"location\" from each object and display as: Location: {{ $json.hazards[0].location }}\n   - If location is missing or null, use \"Unknown Location\".\n3. Extract \"category\" from each object and display as: Category:{{ $json.hazards[0].category }}\n   - If category is missing or null, use \"Not Specified\".\n4. Extract \"precaution\" from each object and display under a separate section labeled \"Precaution:\", with each precaution on a new line starting with \"- \".\n   - If precaution is missing or null, write \"- None specified.\"\n5. Separate each entry with a blank line.\n6. Return **only the formatted text**, do not include any explanations, JSON formatting, or extra content.\n\nInput: {{ $json.hazards }}\n\n",
        "options": {}
      },
