    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are given JSON outputs from two hazard detection models: Floods and Rip Currents.  \n\nExample input:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"Flood\": [\n      {\n        \"latitude\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table').first().json.latitude || '0' }}\",\n        \"longitude\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table').first().json.longitude || '0' }}\",\n        \"location_name\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table').first().json.location_name || 'Unknown' }}\",\n        \"prediction\": {{ parseFloat(($('joblib').first().json.stdout || \"0\").toString().trim().match(/[\\d.]+/)?.[0] || 0) }},\n\n,\n        \"hazard_status\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table').first().json.hazard_status || 'No' }}\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"Rip current\": [\n      {\n        \"latitude\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table1').first().json.latitude || '0' }}\",\n        \"longitude\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table1').first().json.longitude || '0' }}\",\n        \"location_name\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table1').first().json.location_name || 'Unknown' }}\",\n        \"image_url\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table1').first().json.image_url || 'https://example.com/rip_current_image.jpg' }}\",\n        \"confidence\":{{ Number($('Code in JavaScript3').first().json.confidence ?? 0) }}\n\n,\n        \"hazard_status\": \"{{ $('Insert or update rows in a table1').first().json.hazard_status || 'No' }}\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Write a **plain-text email** that is fully readable and understandable by a normal user.  \n2. Include a friendly greeting and closing (e.g., \"Dear User\" and \"Sincerely, The Hazard Detection System\").  \n3. Provide a summary of the total number of Floods and Rip Currents detected.  \n4. For each Flood alert, present details clearly with **one feature per line**, for example:\n\n   Flood Alert 1:  \n   Location: Visakhapatnam  \n   Latitude: 17.782430991378288  \n   Longitude: 83.38512154384739  \n   Prediction: 0.6187  \n   Hazard Status: Yes  \n   Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps?q=17.782430991378288,83.38512154384739  \n\n5. For each Rip Current alert, also show **one feature per line**, for example:\n\n   Rip Current Alert 1:  \n   Location: Goa  \n   Latitude: 15.5470  \n   Longitude: 73.7480  \n   Confidence: 0.6173  \n   Hazard Status: Yes  \n   Image: https://example.com/rip_current_image.jpg  \n\n6. Leave a blank line between alerts for readability.  \n7. Ensure the email reads like a natural report a human can understand, avoiding technical JSON formatting.  \n8. Output only the **plain-text email**.  \n",
        "options": {}
      },
